                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "10 Space Cats of 10! :D Cool space arcade with smooth graphics. I loved the humor in the game and very newbie friendly interface and controls. Can't say it's easy to complete all the 30 levels and Boss fights (I'm still on my way with this), but the game brings a lot of fun and joy.\nActually Spaceguard 80 surprised me twice: \n 1) I didn't expect such a great gameplay from little Indie game with pretty low price. \n 2) I didn't expect upgrades and modifiers for the spaceship here. Well done devs!",
